            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, justice Breyer inquired whether the regulation\u2019s language indicated conflict preemption rather than field preemption."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4f1bb12224c2f72f9255b6072166f3f4a0e5ea8fd26a96cfd1a39e4fe913eea4",
